5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need a logical basis for this decision. I want to see the actual usage patterns and the state of the room.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree we need a basis. I am interested in how we interact in that space, or rather, how we don't.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,Let's make this interesting! I want to know who's actually using the place and where the money is leaking.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's not get too emotional about it. I'm more interested in the financial drain and the actual costs of changing things.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,Peace and clarity come from understanding the environment. I wish to understand the physical boundaries and the traces we leave behind.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@May, ""leaking money"" is vague. We should focus on the data of who is actually occupying the room.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Ryuji, data is useful, but the quality of our conversations—or the lack thereof—matters more for a shared space.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"Oh, Ryuji, you're so serious! I just mean I want to see if we're wasting time on things that don't matter.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"While you all debate the ""vibe,"" I'll be looking at the invoices. Someone has to be the adult here.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is often the smallest things, like a few crumbs or a thin wall, that weigh heaviest on the spirit.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,pass,Ryuji,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
16,1,3,pass,Jonathan,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"I'm curious if the ""awkwardness"" Jonathan mentioned is a recurring theme. Let's dig into the drama.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Drama doesn't pay the bills, May. I'm sticking to the numbers.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Let us remember that a room is not just walls, but the energy we bring into it.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
