30,2,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
31,2,,status,May,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
32,2,,status,Servas,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
33,2,,status,Ryuji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The usage is heavily skewed toward a few people, yet the mess is widespread. This is an inefficient arrangement.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It seems we have no place for the difficult, necessary conversations. We are strangers working side by side.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"Well, it turns out we're paying a fortune to go elsewhere because this room is a disaster. How charming.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,It's a textbook case of poor planning. We're bleeding money on outside hires because we can't decide what this room is.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,I have seen that the walls are thin and the desks are untidy. We are leaking both sound and discipline.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, if the cost of outside hire is high, converting this into a dedicated meeting room is the only rational choice.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,A meeting room is just for formal talk. We need a space where we can actually be human with one another.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"A ""human"" space sounds like a fancy way of saying ""a place to nap."" But the cost of those outside hires is shocking!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,Exactly. The quotes for the fit-outs are a one-time hit. The hourly hire is a permanent leak. The math is simple.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"When the walls are thin, the heart must be kind. But perhaps a physical barrier is needed for peace.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Servas, a partition wall would solve the noise issue and allow for a dual-purpose space if managed strictly.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"If we just build more walls, we will only become more isolated. We need a space that encourages connection.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"I'm not sure I want to spend my day in a ""connection"" zone if it means more unpaid cleaning. Who's doing the bins?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,Let's stop worrying about the bins and look at the bottom line. We are paying for a room we don't have.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"Discipline in the small things, like the bins, reflects the discipline of the mind. We must address both.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"We cannot rely on ""discipline"" alone. We need a defined purpose and a set of rules to avoid this chaos.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Rules are fine, but they don't replace the need for a sanctuary where we can speak honestly.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,I'll vote for whatever stops us from walking to that expensive rental place. My legs are tired.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,I'll support the most cost-effective solution that eliminates the need for outside hire. It's the only logical path.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us seek a balance between the need for silence and the need for community.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
